      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "1. Can you describe a time when you had to innovate within your team to solve a problem? What was the outcome?\n2. How do you approach working with others to achieve a common goal, and can you provide an example of a successful collaboration you were part of?\n3. Tell me about a project where you had to think outside the box to drive growth. How did you and your team contribute to this innovation?\n4. Can you share an experience where you had to work closely with others to create something new? What was the process like, and what was the result?\n5. Describe a situation where you had to collaborate with a diverse team to solve a complex problem. How did you ensure everyone’s ideas were heard and integrated into the final solution?",
